<http://data.silknow.org/object/de5adbc8-d9b1-3ee7-aa23-df6ff6895874>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Bedspread, made of four widths, only one of which is complete; pieced in each lower corner. Brown ink on natural cotton. Design shows alternating horizontal bands of landscape with figures: at left, in first band, a pair of lovers in gardern (spring); at right, same figures walking in wheat field, holding scythe and rake (summer). In second band, at left, pair gathering grapes (autumn); at right, man ice-skating while woman watches. Cotton browned and brittle, many small tears and holes. Trimmed on three sides with natural cotton fringe."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/988b7bd7-93c6-3a9b-a68a-67c6bcc6ccd3> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/4ae440de-8a47-3357-82f7-53a29acf7611> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/122d57a4-d24a-3eef-88ae-686655f98984> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Bedspread, made of four widths, only one of which is complete; pieced in each lower corner. Brown ink on natural cotton. Design shows alternating horizontal bands of landscape with figures: at left, in first band, a pair of lovers in gardern (spring); at right, same figures walking in wheat field, holding scythe and rake (summer). In second band, at left, pair gathering grapes (autumn); at right, man ice-skating while woman watches. Cotton browned and brittle, many small tears and holes. Trimmed on three sides with natural cotton fringe."@en ;
